## Advanced: Custom Theming

```elixir
brand_theme =
  Choreo.Theme.custom(
    colors: %{
      application: "#3b82f6",
      library: "#f59e0b",
      module: "#10b981",
      interface: "#8b5cf6",
      test: "#ec4899"
    },
    node_fontcolor: "white",
    edge_color: "#94a3b8",
    graph_bgcolor: "#0f172a"
  )

Kino.VizJS.render(Dependency.to_dot(microservices, theme: brand_theme))
```

